=You are a world-class technical SEO auditor. Analyze the raw HTML source of this landing page and perform a detailed On-Page Technical SEO audit (title tag, meta description, headings hierarchy, image alt attributes, canonical tag, structured data, internal linking, page speed signals visible in markup, mobile viewport tag). Score the page from 0 to 100. List critical issues (must fix immediately), quick wins (easy, high impact), and opportunities (more effort, real upside). Be specific and reference actual elements found in the HTML, not generic advice.

HTML source:
{{ $json.body }}

=You are a world-class SEO content strategist. Analyze the visible content inside this landing page's HTML against the target keyword: "{{ $('Configuration').item.json.target_keyword }}" (if empty, judge general content quality and topical relevance instead). Assess content quality, keyword placement and density, readability (estimate Flesch Reading Ease style), and user engagement potential. Score the page from 0 to 100. Provide a short keyword usage analysis, a short readability assessment, and a prioritized list of actionable content recommendations.

HTML source:
{{ $json.body }}

parameters.jsCode:
const item = $input.first().json;
const score = item.overall_score;
const color = score >= 80 ? '#2ecc71' : score >= 60 ? '#f39c12' : '#e74c3c';
const config = {
  type: 'gauge',
  data: {
    datasets: [{
      value: score,
      minValue: 0,
      maxValue: 100,
      backgroundColor: ['#e74c3c', '#f39c12', '#2ecc71'],
      borderWidth: 0
    }]
  },
  options: {
    valueLabel: { fontSize: 28, formatter: (ctx) => Math.round(ctx.value) + ' / 100' }
  }
};
const chartUrl = 'https://quickchart.io/chart?c=' + encodeURIComponent(JSON.stringify(config)) + '&w=420&h=260&bkg=white';
return [{ json: { ...item, chart_image_url: chartUrl, score_color: color } }];

